    "raw_listing": {
      "listing_id": 4432511462,
      "user_id": 364270962,
      "shop_id": 25333110,
      "title": "Spiked Fishbone Wallet Chain - Stainless Steel Gothic Punk Biker Pants Chain",
      "description": "This spiked fishbone wallet chain is made from solid 316L stainless steel for punk, gothic, biker, and streetwear styling. Wear it with jeans, cargo pants, or a leather jacket when you want a heavy chain accessory with real weight and presence.\n\nThe design has a sharp fishbone / spine-like structure with a rugged industrial look. It works as a wallet chain, pants chain, trouser chain, or statement streetwear accessory.\n\nGOTHIC STREETWEAR STYLE\n\nMade for:\n- Punk fashion\n- Gothic streetwear\n- Biker outfits\n- Y2K alternative styling\n- Rock and metal looks\n- Jeans, cargo pants, leather jackets, and layered accessories\n\nDETAILS AND CONSTRUCTION\n\n- Fishbone-inspired linked structure\n- Solid 316L stainless steel\n- Silver-tone polished metal finish\n- Secure clip attachment for pants or wallet use\n- Strong enough for daily wear\n\nMATERIAL YOU CAN TRUST\n\nThis chain is made from solid 316L stainless steel for strength, corrosion resistance, and long-term durability. It is not a plated fashion alloy, so it is built for real wear and regular styling.\n\nKEY SPECS\n\n- Material: Solid 316L stainless steel\n- Length: Approx. 67 cm / 26.3 inches\n- Weight: Approx. 50g+\n- Style: Gothic / Punk / Biker / Streetwear\n- SKU: SSG02\n\nWHAT YOU GET\n\n- 1 stainless steel fishbone wallet chain\n- Gift box\n- Care cloth and packaging\n- Ready-to-gift presentation\n\nCARE INSTRUCTIONS\n\nAvoid prolonged exposure to chemicals, perfume, and saltwater. Wipe gently with a soft cloth after wear to maintain the finish and shine.\n\nSHIPPING AND DELIVERY\n\n- Processing time: 2-5 business days\n- Fast worldwide shipping via YunExpress / FedEx\n- Estimated delivery: 3-7 business days after dispatch\n- Tracking included\n\nFAQ\n\nQ: Is the chain heavy?\nA: Yes. It has a solid stainless steel feel with noticeable weight and presence.\n\nQ: Can it attach to jeans or wallets?\nA: Yes. It is designed for pants, wallet, and streetwear styling.\n\nQ: Will it fade or peel?\nA: No. It is made from solid 316L stainless steel, not plated fashion alloy.\n\nQ: Is it suitable as a gift?\nA: Yes. It comes with gift-ready packaging and a care cloth.",
